<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">An incentive fee on net investment income, which we refer to as the subordinated incentive fee on income, is calculated and payable quarterly in
