<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B>Q: Can I invest through my IRA, SEP or <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">after-tax</FONT> deferred account? </B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">A: Yes, subject to the suitability standards. A custodian, trustee or other authorized person must process and forward to us subscriptions made through
