<P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">A: The payment of fees and expenses will reduce: (1)&nbsp;the funds available to us for investments in portfolio companies, (2)&nbsp;the net income
