<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B>Q: Are there any restrictions on the transfer of shares? </B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT
STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">A: No. Shares of our common stock have no preemptive rights and will be freely transferable. We do not intend to list our securities on any securities exchange, and we do not expect there to be a public
