&#151; Risks Related to an Investment in Our Common Stock.&#148; </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B>Q: Will I be able to sell my shares of common stock in a secondary
