<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>Changes in laws or regulations governing our operations may adversely affect our business or cause us to alter our business strategy.
</I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:6px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We and our portfolio companies will be subject to regulation at the local, state, and federal level. Changes to the
