possibility of obtaining similar services from other third party service providers or through an internally managed structure. Based on the information reviewed and the discussion thereof, the board of directors, including a majority of the
non-interested directors, concluded that the investment advisory fee rates are reasonable in relation to the services to be provided. </FONT></P>
