<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">No subordinated incentive fee on income is payable in any calendar quarter in which the <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-incentive</FONT> fee net
investment income does not exceed a quarterly return to investors of 1.75%&nbsp;per quarter on our net assets at the end of the immediately preceding fiscal quarter. We refer to this as the quarterly preferred return. </FONT></P></TD></TR></TABLE>
<P STYLE="font-size:12px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
