<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">For any quarter in which our <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-incentive</FONT> fee net investment income exceeds 2.1875% on our net assets at the
end of the immediately preceding fiscal quarter, the subordinated incentive fee on income shall equal 20% of the amount of our <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">pre-incentive</FONT> fee net investment income, because the preferred return and catch up
will have been achieved. </FONT></P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:12px;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px">&nbsp;</P>
