<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">Pre-incentive</FONT> fee net investment income is defined as interest income, dividend income and any other income
