 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">On April&nbsp;17, 2012, SIC Advisors purchased 1,108,033.24 shares of our common stock for
aggregate gross proceeds of $10,000,000. The consideration represents $9.025 per share. </FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We have entered into an Investment
