<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">A capital gains incentive fee will be earned on realized investments and shall be payable in arrears as of the end of each calendar year during which
the IAA is in effect. If the IAA is terminated, the fee will become payable as of the effective date of such termination. The capital gains incentive fee is based on our realized capital gains on a cumulative basis from inception, computed net of
all realized capital </FONT></P></TD></TR></TABLE>
