</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Preferred stock could be issued with rights and preferences that would adversely affect the holders of common stock.
