<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The Control Share Acquisition Act does not apply (a)&nbsp;to shares acquired in a merger, consolidation or share exchange if the
corporation is a party to the transaction or (b)&nbsp;to acquisitions approved or exempted by the articles of incorporation or bylaws of the corporation. Our bylaws contain a provision exempting from the Control Share Acquisition Act any and all
