 <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px" ALIGN="center"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><A NAME="rom800526_26"></A>DISTRIBUTION REINVESTMENT PLAN </B></FONT></P>
<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">Any investor who purchases shares of our common stock in this offering may elect to participate in our distribution reinvestment plan by
