STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We have adopted an <FONT STYLE="white-space:nowrap">&#147;opt-in&#148;</FONT> distribution reinvestment plan pursuant to which you may elect to have the full amount of your cash distributions reinvested
