<P STYLE="margin-top:12px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT STYLE="font-family:Times New Roman" SIZE="2">The proxy voting decisions of SIC Advisors are made by its portfolio managers and investment professionals under the supervision of SIC
