termination events: (a)&nbsp;a failure to satisfy the portfolio criteria for at least 30 days; (b)&nbsp;a failure to post initial cash collateral or additional collateral as required by the Amended TRS Agreement; (c)&nbsp;a default by Arbor or the
Company with respect to indebtedness in an amount equal to or greater than the lesser of $10,000,000 and 2% of the Company&#146;s net asset </FONT></P>
